  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「お待たせ～♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「ふふふ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-sheriff",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sheriff_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「ちょうど『保安官の詰め所』での勤務時間も終わりだからさ、わたしも転校生くんに付きあわせてもらうね！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「あちこち案内してあげるよ、久しぶりにデートしよう！　な～んちゃって♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-sheriff",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sheriff_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「ふっふっふ。撃ちあいが日常の『西部』では、戦力はひとりでも多いほうがいいしね♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-sheriff",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sheriff_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「まぁ、わたし鈍くさいからあんまり戦力にはならないかもだけど。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-sheriff",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sheriff_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「いちおう立場は『保安官』だからね、『西部』では権力者なんだよ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「『保安官』はね、この課外活動……『西部劇っぽいこと』の運営者側なんだ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「『保安官』にしか、入れない場所とかもあるしね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「『保安官』を撃つのは重罪だから、すごい無法者でもなければ撃ちあいを仕掛けてこないはずだよ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-sheriff",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sheriff_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「わたしが転校生くんを守ってあげる！　ふふ～ん♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-sheriff",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sheriff_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「そういえば、転校生くんは何でこんな遅めのタイミングで『西部』にきたの？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-sheriff",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sheriff_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「また生徒会とかに、厄介な頼まれごとをされちゃった感じ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「ふぅん。明日からは連休も終わりで学校だけど、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「『西部』が楽しすぎて帰ってこなさそうなひとが何人かいると？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-sheriff",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sheriff_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「そんな『困ったさん』たちに、ちゃんと明日から登校するように伝えるのが役目なんだね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「その依頼の出どころ……生徒会長さんは、連休中はドタバタしてて身動きがとれないと。ふむふむ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-sheriff",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sheriff_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「まったくもう、相変わらず気軽に使われちゃってるね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-sheriff",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sheriff_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「すっかり生徒会のパシリだよね～、まぁ転校生くんらしいけど……♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-sheriff",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sheriff_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「わたしも、よかったら手伝うよ。ううん、協力させて！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「転校生くんは、いつも他人の事情にきりきり舞いしてて心配だなぁ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「えぇっと、その『困ったさん』たちの目星とかはついてるのかな？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「『保安官』は、情報が集まる立場だからね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「もしかしたら、その『困ったさん』たちの居場所とか教えてあげられるかもよ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「ふぅん、この『西部』では『三大賞金首』と呼ばれてるひとたち……？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-sheriff",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sheriff_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「それなら知ってるよ、『西部』では有名人だもん♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-sheriff",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sheriff_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「『三大賞金首』の手配書があるから、見せてあげる。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-sheriff",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sheriff_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「えぇっと、どこに仕舞いこんじゃったかな……？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-sheriff",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sheriff_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「ちょっと待ってね、ごそごそ♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-sheriff",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sheriff_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「あった！　これこれ、『西部』で最も高額の賞金がかけられた……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「それが『三大賞金首』だよ、転校生くん！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-sheriff",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sheriff_expression/angry",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「一人目は、『西部』で最も忌み嫌われる最凶最悪のアウトロー！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「『隻眼の無法者』！　賞金額、６６６＄！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-sheriff",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sheriff_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「あぁうん、軽音部のひとだねこれ。たしか、黒森すず先輩？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-sheriff",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sheriff_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「どうも他の軽音部の子たちを引きつれて、ギャング団みたいのを結成して……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「あちこちで、暴れ回ってるみたいだね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「銀行を襲撃したり、手当たり次第に通行人を撃って金品を奪ったりしてるっぽいよ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-sheriff",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sheriff_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「そういう諸々の罪が加算されて、賞金額は『西部』で最大だね～♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-sheriff",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sheriff_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「ちなみに６６６＄って、かなり尋常じゃない金額だよ。ふつうの賞金首は、１＄とかだもん。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-sheriff",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sheriff_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「えぇっと、『西部』では１日１＄で生活できるぐらいの感じね？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「わかりやすい悪役って感じだけど、何でそんなにヤンチャしてるのかなぁ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「まぁ黒森先輩といえば、君咲学院でも無法者で有名だけど……？」"
  }
]